            "review_title": "Review at Bun Dau Ngo Nho Phu Nho",
            "review_text": "Seafarrwide\nSydney, Australia30 contributions\n0\nFantastic authentic Vietnamese food\nOct 2024 • Couples\nFabulous authentic food! We were tourists to Ho Chi Minh and stumbled across this lovely very busy restaurant in a side alley off Pasteur street. It looked to be full of local young workers so we thought it must be good food. The service was quick and the food was fresh and delicious! It was one of our favourite finds in Vietnam. We highly recommend you try their menu!\nRead more\nWritten October 27, 2024",
